import"./chunk-NWJ5J3BN.js";var e={subtitle:"Creating my own story through coding and passion",tips:[{icon:"psychology",title:"My Journey",tip:`From navigating through academic world, joining fascinating organizations, gaining independence and enriching my views abroad, to working on a complex project, while learning the technology at the same time, my path has been anything but conventional, but it's always been exciting. While writing my thesis I found myself asking: 'How can bring my theoretical ideas to life?' My search for a practical yet creative outlet led me to frontend development which quickly blossomed into a genuine passion. 
Self-teaching Angular while simultaneously working on a reactive business app as a junior was a steep learning curve,  and I am deeply grateful to my colleagues and mentors for their guidance during that pivotal time.`},{icon:"favorite",title:"My Passion",tip:"While learning Angular presented its challenges, the immense satisfaction of building functional solutions that real people can use has made every step of the journey rewarding. I find great joy in crafting effortless, user-centric experiences, quietly solving problems to improve usability. Feature development and component architecture planning has their own charm, but my true motivation lies in the impact of the final, polished product."},{icon:"emoji_people",title:"My Values",tip:"While I'm a productive independent worker, I fundamentally believe that true project success is rooted in strong collaboration I believe a team can be successful if its members can synchronize the knowledge and skills they bring, and accept each other's constructive criticism with understanding and respect. I prioritize assertive communication and pride myself on thoughtful, creative approach to brainstorming and problem-solving, always striving to be a supportive and engaged team member."},{icon:"workspace_premium",title:"My Goal",tip:"They say work can become a true passion in the right environment, and my ambition is to find that space My goal is to work in a collaborative setting where I can experience the flow state while coding, engage in stimulating discussions with fellow passionate developers, and ultimately contribute to building impactful solutions that truly make a difference."}]};export{e as DATA};
